Earth Embedding
https://github.com/GISWLH/earth-embedding

This project is a derivative of rs-embed by Dingqi Ye and the CyberGIS
contributors (https://github.com/cybergis/rs-embed), licensed under Apache-2.0.
The original license and source notices are retained. GISWLH maintains this
independent extension; no endorsement by the upstream authors is implied.

The 2026 Earth Embedding extension adds location-encoder integrations,
direct AlphaEarth Foundations COG access, release-object taxonomy,
research-to-software documentation, multilingual guides and new visual assets.
See CHANGELOG.md and docs/provenance.md for the extension boundaries.

Bundled model implementations retain their own licenses in
src/rs_embed/embedders/_vendor/. Model checkpoints and third-party data are
not relicensed under this project's Apache-2.0 license. In particular,
Esri software/model terms and AlphaEarth Foundations CC-BY-4.0 apply separately.
